","v":"OpenAI/*"},{"t":"text","v":" 这几条（base_url 为空的 OpenAI 原生条目）在未设置\n"},{"t":"code","v":"OPENAI_API_KEY"},{"t":"text","v":" 时会自动改走 "},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"OpenRouter"}]},{"t":"text","v":"（"},{"t":"code","v":"OPENROUTER_API_KEY"},{"t":"text","v":"，模型名映射为\n"},{"t":"code","v":"openai/*"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"},{"t":"code","v":"gpt-5.x"},{"t":"text","v":" 直连 OpenAI 需组织实名认证，因此只要设置了 "},{"t":"code","v":"OPENROUTER_API_KEY"},{"t":"text","v":"\n就优先走 OpenRouter。带专属 "},{"t":"code","v":"base_url"},{"t":"text","v":" 的条目（Kimi/豆包）不参与回退。"}]}]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"提供商列表是可配置的"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：在 "},{"t":"code","v":"benchmark.py"},{"t":"text","v":" 的 "},{"t":"code","v":"DEFAULT_PROVIDERS"},{"t":"text","v":" 里追加\n"},{"t":"code","v":"ProviderConfig(...)"},{"t":"text","v":" 即可扩展。所有提供商都走同一套 OpenAI 兼容协议，\n只是 "},{"t":"code","v":"base_url"},{"t":"text","v":" 与 "},{"t":"code","v":"model"},{"t":"text","v":" 不同——这正是可以\"同一模型对比不同提供商\"\n（如书中提到的 DeepSeek 官方 vs SiliconFlow）的原因。"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"已有运行结果（示例）","id":"rh-16"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"以下是一次真实运行的输出（"},{"t":"code","v":"python demo.py --num-requests 10 --concurrency 3"},{"t":"text","v":"，\n测试机在中国大陆网络环境，"},{"t":"code","v":"2026-07"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"数字为真实测得，非虚构"}]},{"t":"text","v":"；\n不同网络/时段会有波动，请以自己跑出的结果为准。"}]},{"kind":"code","lang":"text","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Provider/Model            | 成功率       | TTFT均值 | TTFT_p95 | 端到端均值 | 端到端p95 | 吞吐      | 输出tok</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>--------------------------+--------------+----------+----------+------------+-----------+-----------+--------</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>OpenAI/gpt-5.6-luna       | 10/10 (100%) | 1360ms   | 2334ms   | 1.73s      | 2.54s     | 174.9 t/s | 26</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Moonshot/moonshot-v1-8k   | 10/10 (100%) | 530ms    | 671ms    | 0.89s      | 1.07s     | 92.1 t/s  | 32</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Doubao/doubao-1.5-pro-32k | 10/10 (100%) | 1097ms   | 1409ms   | 2.32s      | 2.91s     | 36.2 t/s  | 44</span></span></code></pre>"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"结论（基于上面这次运行）","id":"rh-17"},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"可用性"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：本次三家全部 10/10（100%）成功。可用性差异往往要在更大样本、\n更高并发或更长时间窗口下才暴露——这正是书中强调\"一周每小时探测\"的原因。\n代码已把单点失败设计成\"记为可用性下降、不中断整表\"，便于长时间挂机采样。"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"首 token 延迟（TTFT）"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：本测试机在国内网络下，Kimi 的 TTFT（~530ms）明显低于\n跨境访问的 OpenAI/gpt-5.6-luna（~1.36s）；豆包 TTFT（~1.1s）略低于 OpenAI 但端到端更长。\n"},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"TTFT 强依赖网络位置"}]},{"t":"text","v":"——同一份代码在美国机房跑，OpenAI 的 TTFT 会大幅下降。"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"吞吐"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：本次 gpt-5.6-luna（175 t/s）> Kimi（92 t/s）> 豆包（36 t/s）。\n吞吐决定长响应的等待时间，与 TTFT 是两个独立维度。"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"稳定性（p95）"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：看 p95 与均值的差距。gpt-5.6-luna 跨境访问，TTFT p95(2.33s)/均值(1.36s)\n拉开较大，长尾更重；Kimi 的 p95 与均值最接近，本次最稳。"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"选型启示"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：不存在\"全面最优\"的一家——延迟、吞吐、可用性、价格是"},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"多维权衡"}]},{"t":"text","v":"。\n面向国内用户的实时交互场景，低 TTFT 的本地化服务体验更好；\n批处理/长文本生成则更看重吞吐与单价。"},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"务必在你自己的部署网络环境下实测"}]},{"t":"text","v":"，\n不要直接照搬第三方监测平台（如 Artificial Analysis）的数字。"}]}]]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"文件说明","id":"rh-18"},{"kind":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[[{"t":"text","v":"文件"}],[{"t":"text","v":"作用"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","v":"benchmark.py"}],[{"t":"text","v":"核心：提供商配置、单次流式测量、并发调度、指标聚合（含 p99/std/聚合吞吐）、并发扫描 "},{"t":"code","v":"sweep_concurrency"},{"t":"text","v":"、合成数据 "},{"t":"code","v":"synthetic_summary"}]],[[{"t":"code","v":"demo.py"}],[{"t":"text","v":"命令行入口：解析参数、跑测试（含并发压测 / "},{"t":"code","v":"--mock"},{"t":"text","v":" 离线自检）、打印对比表、导出 JSON"}]],[[{"t":"code","v":"requirements.txt"}],[{"t":"text","v":"依赖（openai SDK + 可选 python-dotenv）"}]],[[{"t":"code","v":"env.example"}],[{"t":"text","v":"key 配置模板"}]]]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"注意事项","id":"rh-19"},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"成本控制"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：默认 "},{"t":"code","v":"max_tokens=64"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"N=10"},{"t":"text","v":"，全跑成本极低。调大参数前请留意计费。"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"限流"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：把并发或 N 调很大时可能触发提供商 RPM/TPM 限流，届时会以失败形式\n计入可用性下降——这本身也是一种\"实测限流阈值\"的方式（书中实验 7-10 的一环）。"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"TTFT 与网络强相关"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：跨境访问的服务 TTFT 会显著偏高，结论需结合部署地点解读。"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"OpenRouter 回退"}]},{"t":"text","v":"：未设置 "},{"t":"code","v":"OPENAI_API_KEY"},{"t":"text","v":" 时，"},{"t":"code","v":"OpenAI/*"},{"t":"text","v":" 条目自动经 OpenRouter 路由\n（需 "},{"t":"code","v":"OPENROUTER_API_KEY"},{"t":"text","v":"，"},{"t":"code","v":"gpt-*"},{"t":"text","v":" 映射为 "},{"t":"code","v":"openai/*"},{"t":"text","v":"）；"},{"t":"code","v":"gpt-5.x"},{"t":"text","v":" 只要有 "},{"t":"code","v":"OPENROUTER_API_KEY"},{"t":"text","v":"\n即优先走 OpenRouter（直连需实名认证）。其它提供商（DEEPSEEK / SILICONFLOW 等）如需启用，\n在 "},{"t":"code","v":"DEFAULT_PROVIDERS"},{"t":"text","v":" 中补充配置并设置对应环境变量即可。"}]}]]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"检查自己的解释","id":"rh-20"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"聊天应用与批量离线分析更应优先关注哪种延迟或吞吐指标？"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":3,"text":"English","id":"rh-21"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"This directory contains two layers. "},{"t":"code","v":"demo.py"},{"t":"text","v":" is the short interactive sampler;\n"},{"t":"code","v":"campaign.py"},{"t":"text","v":" is the "},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"complete, resumable Experiment 7-10 campaign"}]},{"t":"text","v":". The latter\nsupports OpenAI-compatible, native Anthropic, and native Gemini APIs and records\nevery real request in SQLite."}]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"The complete campaign supports:"}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"the 8K / 32K / 128K input × 512 / 2048 output workload matrix;"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"at least 100 requests per provider/model/cell;"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"exact TTFT, end-to-end latency, thinking TTFT, reported reasoning length,\ntoken usage, cache hits, and error classification;"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"a 168-hour hourly availability monitor with outage duration, MTTR, and longest\ncontinuous availability analysis;"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"a measured concurrency ramp with RPM and input/output TPM saturation;"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"cached/input/output pricing and a six-round Agent cost trace;"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"an explicit same-model/different-provider comparison group (DeepSeek V4 Flash on the official DeepSeek API and SiliconFlow);"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"resumability through unique request cells in SQLite and a strict completion audit."}]}]]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"The quick sampler still supports:"}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Concurrency stress testing"}]},{"t":"text","v":": sweep concurrency to identify rate limits and observe metric curves."}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Offline mock mode"}]},{"t":"text","v":" ("},{"t":"code","v":"--mock"},{"t":"text","v":"): synthetic data pipeline for verifying aggregation logic without API keys/network."}]}]]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Synthetic mode is never accepted by "},{"t":"code","v":"campaign.py"},{"t":"text","v":" and cannot populate the\nofficial evidence database."}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":3,"text":"Full campaign","id":"rh-22"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Review "},{"t":"code","v":"campaign_config.json"},{"t":"text","v":" before a cost-sensitive run. Pricing fields are\ndeliberately explicit; "},{"t":"code","v":"analysis.py"},{"t":"text","v":" refuses to declare the campaign complete\nwhile any cached/input/output rate is missing."}]},{"kind":"code","lang":"bash","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># Real API integration smoke (small scope is visibly labelled)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">python</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> campaign.py</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> workload</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --smoke</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --requests</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">  --context-tokens</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 256</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --output-tokens</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 128</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">  --provider</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77\"> '</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">Ark/doubao-seed-1.6</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">  --campaign-id</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> integration-smoke</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --db</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> results/integration-smoke.sqlite3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># Official standardized workload: defaults are 3 contexts × 2 outputs × N=100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">python</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> campaign.py</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> workload</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --campaign-id</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> release-2026-07</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># Actual RPM/TPM ramp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">python</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> campaign.py</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> rate-limit</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --campaign-id</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> release-2026-07</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># Six-turn stable-prefix Agent cost/cache trace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">python</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> campaign.py</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> agent-cost</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --campaign-id</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> release-2026-07</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># Keep this process alive for one week; every hourly cell is resumable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">python</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> campaign.py</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> availability</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --duration-hours</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 168</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --interval-seconds</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 3600</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">  --campaign-id</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> release-2026-07</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">python</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> analysis.py</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --campaign-id</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> release-2026-07</span></span></code></pre>"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"code","v":"analysis.py"},{"t":"text","v":" writes JSON and Markdown reports and prints\n"},{"t":"code","v":"Official completion: True"},{"t":"text","v":" only after every manuscript requirement has direct\ndatabase evidence. A smoke run is useful validation, but it can never satisfy\nthe 100-request or 168-hour gates."}]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"The completion audit requires every configured provider—not merely one working\nprovider—to have the complete workload, 169 hourly boundary probes spanning 168\nhours, rate ramp, and six-round cost trace. Pricing is accepted only when input,\ncached-input, and output rates are all pinned together with an authoritative\n"},{"t":"code","v":"source_url"},{"t":"text","v":" and "},{"t":"code","v":"as_of"},{"t":"text","v":" date. Prices remain in the provider's published native\ncurrency. A non-USD price also requires "},{"t":"code","v":"usd_per_currency_unit"},{"t":"text","v":", "},{"t":"code","v":"fx_source_url"},{"t":"text","v":",\nand "},{"t":"code","v":"fx_as_of"},{"t":"text","v":" before the cross-provider USD cost gate can pass; CNY values are\nnever copied into USD-labelled fields. A null rate cannot pass simply because a\nsmoke run reported zero tokens in that category. The same-model provider group must also\nhave successful official workload cells on both endpoints. The configured\nidentifiers are "},{"t":"code","v":"deepseek-v4-flash"},{"t":"text","v":" on the official API and\n"},{"t":"code","v":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash"},{"t":"text","v":" on SiliconFlow. Ark's\n"},{"t":"code","v":"deepseek-v4-flash-260425"},{"t":"text","v":" remains a third independent deployment in the wider\nprovider matrix, but it is not substituted for either comparison arm."}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":3,"text":"Metric definitions","id":"rh-23"},{"kind":"table","align":[null,null,null],"header":[[{"t":"text","v":"Metric"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Meaning"}],[{"t":"text","v":"How measured"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","v":"Success rate"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Availability"}],[{"t":"text","v":"successful request count / total"}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"TTFT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Time to first token"}],[{"t":"text","v":"stream first non-empty chunk - request start"}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"End-to-end latency"}],[{"t":"text","v":"complete response time"}],[{"t":"text","v":"request start -> final chunk"}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"Throughput (tokens/s)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"generation speed"}],[{"t":"text","v":"output token count / (end-to-end - TTFT)"}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"p50 / p95 / p99"}],[{"t":"text","v":"latency percentiles"}],[{"t":"text","v":"interpolation over successful requests"}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"std"}],[{"t":"text","v":"standard deviation"}],[{"t":"text","v":"per-provider latency dispersion"}]],[[{"t":"text","v":"aggregate throughput / RPS"}],[{"t":"text","v":"batch throughput metrics"}],[{"t":"text","v":"aggregated output token rate and request rate"}]]]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"If "},{"t":"code","v":"usage.completion_tokens"},{"t":"text","v":" is unavailable, token count falls back to chunk-count approximation with a documented caveat."}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":3,"text":"Run","id":"rh-24"},{"kind":"code","lang":"bash","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># From the repository root: use the shared Chapter 6 environment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">uv</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> sync</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --locked</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --python</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 3.12</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> --extra</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> ch6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># Activate it before changing directories:<